Subject: [PATCH 5.10 030/124] tty: serial: fsl_lpuart: avoid checking for transfer complete when UARTCTRL_SBK is asserted in lpuart32_tx_empty
Date: Tue, 18 Apr 2023 14:20:49 +0200
